1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,505
Two hundred nineteen to one.

2
00:00:01,952 --> 00:00:06,167
That was how House Democrats voted for a federal right to abortion.

3
00:00:06,623 --> 00:00:10,713
Their platform goes further: restore Roe, repeal the Hyde Amendment,

4
00:00:10,982 --> 00:00:12,177
pass the Equality Act.

5
00:00:12,128 --> 00:00:16,370
So how do these promises measure up against the Bible?

6
00:00:18,866 --> 00:00:20,031
First, life.

7
00:00:20,475 --> 00:00:23,201
The bill they backed, the Women's Health Protection Act,

8
00:00:23,455 --> 00:00:26,405
would create a federal right to abortion before viability,

9
00:00:26,754 --> 00:00:31,585
and after it when a provider judges it necessary for the patient's life or health.

10
00:00:31,979 --> 00:00:34,594
The platform would also end the Hyde Amendment,

11
00:00:34,872 --> 00:00:37,139
which bars most federal funding of abortion.

12
00:00:37,594 --> 00:00:39,233
Supporters call this health care and freedom.

13
00:00:39,458 --> 00:00:45,846
Scripture says of the unborn: you knitted me together in my mother's womb.

14
00:00:46,033 --> 00:00:47,048
Second, family.

15
00:00:47,487 --> 00:00:51,246
In 2022, Democrats, with 39 House Republicans,

16
00:00:51,421 --> 00:00:53,852
wrote same-sex marriage into federal law,

17
00:00:54,167 --> 00:00:56,021
with protections for religious groups.

18
00:00:56,426 --> 00:01:00,135
Jesus defined marriage from creation: male and female,

19
00:01:00,498 --> 00:01:03,070
and the two shall become one flesh.

20
00:01:03,266 --> 00:01:08,001
On children, the platform opposes state bans on gender-affirming care.

21
00:01:08,356 --> 00:01:12,296
The Biden administration challenged Tennessee's ban for minors.

22
00:01:12,695 --> 00:01:15,745
In 2025, the Supreme Court upheld it.

23
00:01:16,028 --> 00:01:18,371
Supporters cite medical associations.

24
00:01:18,689 --> 00:01:22,917
A 2024 review for England's health service found the evidence weak.

25
00:01:23,292 --> 00:01:27,230
Genesis says: male and female he created them.

26
00:01:27,399 --> 00:01:28,561
Third, conscience.

27
00:01:28,517 --> 00:01:31,744
The platform promises to protect religious freedom.

28
00:01:32,165 --> 00:01:35,552
Yet the Equality Act, backed by every voting House Democrat,

29
00:01:35,869 --> 00:01:38,110
says the Religious Freedom Restoration Act shall not

30
00:01:38,392 --> 00:01:41,381
provide a claim or a defense under it.

31
00:01:41,725 --> 00:01:44,830
Backers say faith must not excuse discrimination.

32
00:01:45,227 --> 00:01:47,791
Critics say it strips a shield for conscience.

33
00:01:48,144 --> 00:01:52,070
The apostles said: we must obey God rather than men.

34
00:01:52,265 --> 00:01:54,209
Not every Democrat agrees.

35
00:01:54,622 --> 00:01:58,546
About one in seven tells Pew abortion should be mostly illegal.

36
00:01:58,965 --> 00:02:02,310
But a platform shows what a party will do with power.

37
00:02:02,648 --> 00:02:06,962
When the law departs from God's design, whose word will we follow?
